{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Search for Above Average Life</strong> is a light-hearted bullet-hell adventure where friendship is a matter of overcoming the language barrier. Play as SAAL, a lonely exploration robot, scanning planets and befriending the galaxy\u2019s strangest inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how to communicate\u2014Speak, Write, Gesture, or Dance\u2014then dodge red \u201cmisunderstanding\u201d projectiles and collect green \u201cunderstanding\u201d to build trust. Expand your star map, meet eccentric aliens, unlock hints, and discover what it means to find life that\u2019s truly above average.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954290?t=1762264834","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954290?t=1762264834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954290/20ccfc60856988460dca8ca0d876e9134de63198/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762264834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954290/20ccfc60856988460dca8ca0d876e9134de63198/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762264834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3987300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Search for Above Average Life</strong> is a light-hearted bullet-hell adventure where friendship is a matter of overcoming the language barrier. Play as SAAL, a lonely exploration robot, scanning planets and befriending the galaxy\u2019s strangest inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choo